{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-possessive-si--si-causative-pretend-construction","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si","topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si--pretend"],"statement":{"en":"The combination of the prefix si- with a causative verb or causative suffix encodes a pretended or simulative action ('to pretend to...').","ja":"接頭辞 si- と使役動詞または使役接尾辞の組み合わせは、ふりをする行為（見せかけ）を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"regularly","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["si-","-re","-te","-e","-ka"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaevakobayashi2022@handbook-epub/l0100-20","stance":"reports"},{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0125-01","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0185-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-possessive-si--the-prefix-si-has-a-primary-anticausative-function","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si","topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si--overview"],"statement":{"en":"The prefix si- has a primary anticausative function, but can also be used productively as an autocausative, as a reflexive-causative, and to mark reflexivity on relational nouns.","ja":"接頭辞 si- は主要な反使役機能を持つが、自己使役、再帰使役、また位置名詞における再帰性の標識としても生産的に用いられる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["si-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:bugaeva2012@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0016-07","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-possessive-si--attached-to-nouns-shi-imparts-meanings-such-as","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si","topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si--reflexive-possessive"],"statement":{"en":"Attached to nouns, shi- imparts meanings such as 'true/real' (1), 'great/large' (2), and 'one's own' (3).","ja":"shi- は名詞に付いて、(1)「本当の」「眞の」、(2)「大なる」、(3)「自分の」という意味を添える。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":["attached to nouns"]},"forms":["shi-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0124-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-possessive-si--attached-to-verbs-shi-expresses-reflexive-meanings-to","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si","topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si--reflexive-possessive"],"statement":{"en":"Attached to verbs, shi- expresses reflexive meanings 'to oneself' or 'oneself', though it often ends up having middle-voice semantics.","ja":"shi- は動詞に付いて「自分に」「自分を」の意味を表すが、中相になってしまうことも多い。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":["attached to verbs"]},"forms":["shi-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0124-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-possessive-si--intransitive-unaccusative-verbs-whose-subject-corresponds-to-the","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si","topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si--reflexive-possessive"],"statement":{"en":"Intransitive (unaccusative) verbs whose subject corresponds to the affected object of a transitive verb are frequently derived in the form of si- + transitive verb (e.g. turi 'stretch sth.' -> si-turi 'stretch [intr.]', rutu 'slide sth.' -> si-rutu 'slide [intr.]').","ja":"対象に影響を及ぼす他動詞に対して、その対象を主語にとる自動詞（非対格自動詞）は si- + 他動詞という形で派生されるものが多い（例: turi に対する si-turi、rutu に対する si-rutu など）。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["si-","si-turi","si-rutu","si-suye","si-yupu"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0185-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-possessive-si--the-concept-of-an-event-happening-by-itself","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si","topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si--reflexive-possessive"],"statement":{"en":"The concept of an event happening by itself with no agent involved is expressed by the verb prefix si-.","ja":"動作主が関与せず何かが自発的に起きるという概念は、動詞接頭辞 si- によって表される。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["si-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0024-10","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-possessive-si--the-verb-siyekimatekka-to-threaten-can-be-morphologically","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si","topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si--reflexive-possessive"],"statement":{"en":"The verb siyekimatekka 'to threaten' can be morphologically analyzed as si-y-e-kimatek-ka, where si- is the indirect reflexive, y- is an epenthetic consonant, e- is the applicative, kimatek is 'to panic', and -ka is the causative suffix.","ja":"siyekimatekka「脅す」という語は形態論的に si-y-e-kimatek-ka と分析され、si- は間接的再帰、y- は挿入子音、e- は充当態、kimatek は「あわてる、動転する」、-ka は使役と解釈される。"},"type":"analysis","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/chitose"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["siyekimatekka","si-","y-","e-","kimatek","-ka"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0161-02","stance":"proposes"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-possessive-si--in-indirect-reflexive-expressions-with-si-the-meaning","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si","topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si--reflexive-possessive"],"statement":{"en":"In indirect reflexive expressions with si-, the meaning of an external agent ('by someone') does not necessarily have to be overtly indicated in the sentence and can simply be an implicit presupposition.","ja":"si- による間接的再帰表現において、「誰かに」という意味は暗黙の前提として含意されているだけでよく、文中に示される必要は必ずしもない。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"possible","conditions":[]},"forms":["si-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0267-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-possessive-si--the-verb-sikiru-to-turn-is-analyzed-as","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si","topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si--reflexive-possessive"],"statement":{"en":"The verb sikiru 'to turn' is analyzed as indirect reflexive si- + kiru 'to rotate / turn around'.","ja":"動詞 sikiru「向く」は、間接再帰の si-「自分を」＋ kiru「回す」と分析される。"},"type":"analysis","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["sikiru","si-","kiru"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0327-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:valency/reflexive-possessive-si--a-less-productive-reflexive-prefix-occurs-in-the","revision":1,"topic":"topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si","topics":["topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si","topic:valency/reflexive-possessive-si--reflexive-possessive"],"statement":{"en":"A less productive reflexive prefix occurs in the form si-.","ja":"si- という形の、より生産性の低い再帰接頭辞が存在する。"},"type":"existence","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"exists","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["si-"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:shibatani1990@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0033-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
